  "question": {
    "text": "If the lengths of the tangents from <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to a circle are <math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units and&nbsp;<math><msqrt><mn>18</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units respectively, then the length of the tangent from <math><mi>R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7,15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the same circle is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>98</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>170</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "is_correct": true
