  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, circle is <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>and the length of the tangent from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;units, then<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math> implies<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>69</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>69</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>58</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;(from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>225</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>69</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>170</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>170</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> length of the tangent from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is <math><msqrt><mn>170</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units</p>"
  }
